<h1>Dekopon on Kubernetes</h1>
<p>Install the broker probe first; enable the gateway when its chat, model and catalog configuration are ready.</p>
</header>
<nav class="guide-jumps" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#install">Install and verify</a><a href="#upgrade">Upgrade</a><a href="#pod">Pod cutaway</a><a href="#gateway">Enable chat</a><a href="#providers">Install providers</a><a href="#state">State and files</a><a href="#startup">Troubleshoot</a>
